agent-harness (0.3.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Web GUI: local control surface with Overview, Agents, real-terminal
    Commands tab (menu + shell PTY modes), Memory, Skills, Project,
    Activity, Settings (19 themes), About, Update modal with live status.
  * Menu-only interactive CLI with Local models submenu; shell removed.
  * 13 features: init dry-run/force, doctor json, adapter remove,
    instinct test, memory stats/search/backup, research search/remove,
    skill lint/update, upgrade check.
  * Perf: haveBin scans PATH in-process, update-info caches main SHA.
  * Install hints point at theelephantcoder.com/agent-harness.

